  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p ><strong>What it is: </strong>A body spritz with notes of apricot, vanilla, and sheer amber. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type: </strong>Warm Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes: </strong>Glazed Apricot, Vanilla Absolute, Sheer Amber</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description: </strong>With notes of glazed apricot, vanilla absolute, and sheer amber, Lilyhaze is a warm and comforting scent that is evocative of the rich and radiant nostalgia that comes with the holidays.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>About the Fragrance:</strong> Glossier’s Body Spritz debuts in Lilyhaze—a limited-edition holiday scent inspired by the warmth and joy of cherished traditions. </p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\" ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-For the best scent experience, spritz liberally as the first step in your fragrance routine. Reapply throughout the day as desired.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Alcohol Denat., Water/Aqua/Eau, Fragrance/Parfum, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Vanillin, Hexamethylindanopyran, Benzyl Salicylate, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Limonene, Coumarin, Pinene, Benzaldehyde, Cananga Odorata Oil/Extract, Rose Ketones.</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p ><strong>What it is: </strong>A body spritz with notes of apricot, vanilla, and sheer amber. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type: </strong>Warm Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes: </strong>Glazed Apricot, Vanilla Absolute, Sheer Amber</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description: </strong>With notes of glazed apricot, vanilla absolute, and sheer amber, Lilyhaze is a warm and comforting scent that is evocative of the rich and radiant nostalgia that comes with the holidays.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>About the Fragrance:</strong> Glossier’s Body Spritz debuts in Lilyhaze—a limited-edition holiday scent inspired by the warmth and joy of cherished traditions. </p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\" ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-For the best scent experience, spritz liberally as the first step in your fragrance routine. Reapply throughout the day as desired.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Alcohol Denat., Water/Aqua/Eau, Fragrance/Parfum, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Vanillin, Hexamethylindanopyran, Benzyl Salicylate, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Limonene, Coumarin, Pinene, Benzaldehyde, Cananga Odorata Oil/Extract, Rose Ketones.</p></div></details>",
